---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About me and why I write here."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-09-30')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Jiekai. I'm a computer science student, and I like figuring out how
		things work — then writing down what I find.
	</p>

	<p>
		I started this site as a place for my notes. I don't write on any schedule —
		only when I have something worth saying.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most of what I write is about what I'm studying — computer systems,
		data structures, and the small things that confused me along the way.
	</p>

	<p>
		If something here helps you, that's enough reason for me to keep going.
	</p>
</Layout>